Subject: Backport RAW/DNG removal policy for Windows x64
Base-Repository: https://github.com/mono/skia
Base-Commit: 4bed689c9c9eb77a120c6a9d54af6a572c85d1c2
Upstream-Precedent: https://github.com/mono/SkiaSharp/pull/5162
Native-Precedent: https://github.com/mono/skia/pull/373
Scope: current Windows x64 release investigation only; apply only in the upstream native build workspace.
Apply this patch inside the repository named above, separately from the other patch.
The DEPS patch affects the native source checkout globally: do not run other platforms
until their true RAW/DNG overrides have also been disabled and validated.
A rebuilt DLL and the recorded build verification remain required.

